WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:09.200
Manage the application form
This editor controls the public apprenticeship eligibility form. Page text, sections and questions are edited in a draft before publication.

2
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:16.800
Organise sections
Select a section to review its questions and guidance. Use the available controls to edit or reorder sections and the questions within them.

3
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:24.300
Edit questions and choices
Configure supported question types, labels, choices and conditions. Review required questions and dependencies. Built-in questions may have additional restrictions.

4
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:32.001
Publish the reviewed draft
Check the draft and publish confirmation before updating the public form. Removing a published question preserves its stored answers. Resolve validation messages before publishing.
